{"title":"","link":"http://scripting.com/2025/10/05.html#a155916","date":1759679956000,"content":"In 2014 I wrote a <a href=\"http://scripting.com/2014/09/28/myManifestoForWebWriting.html\">manifesto</a> about web writing. A decade later later, I'm still trying to get writing on the web to work again. It was on a good track before <a href=\"http://scripting.com/2025/10/05/180457.html\">the rude interruption</a>.","author":"","siteTitle":"Scripting News","siteHash":"d6ad59631287cc248e52fdfe0c4f962c0fd08643d455b40f799700d8b2f97c65","entryHash":"6f63443e59db77fcca338053fe75e0a6ac1e2d979285356ba270a5d89e61ae0e","category":"Sites"}